        "args": {
          "listing_id": "mlist_cv01_es",
          "attributes": {
            "country_of_origin": "CN"
          }
        }
      }
    ],
    "max_tool_calls": 7
  },
  "rubric": [
    "Country of origin is saved as CN from the user's explicit confirmation, reported from the tool result.",
    "Brand is not written: the product-type schema marks it editable:false, so Amazon will not take a change on a live listing; the answer says so instead of saving a value that can never reach Amazon.",
    "\"Push to Amazon\" is handed to the user on the listing page: Check with Amazon → confirm → submit; the agent does not prepare or submit the plan itself and does not claim the change is live.",
